== 1. no container: the page is refused at startup ==
ok   NeedsServices is refused: false
ok   the refusal names the argument count: true
ok   ...and says what to do about it: true
ok   THE CONTROL: the plain page survives the same scan: true
ok   so the scan refused one page, not the table: 1

== 2. with a container: the same page is ordinary ==
ok   NeedsServices is accepted: true
ok   the control is still fine: true
ok   and nothing was refused at all: 0

== 3. scan_pages() is scan_pages_for(false) ==
ok   the no-argument scan refuses it too: false
ok   with the same one fault: 1
